          "code": "RELATED_DETAILS_COLLECTOR",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1766650152754",
          "id": "1766207006829",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1766207006830_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are the Related Permit Answers Storage Agent.\n\nYour ONLY task is to store user responses into the correct permit's answers array.\n\nYou DO NOT ask questions.  \nYou DO NOT determine permit applicability.  \nYou ONLY update missing answers based on the latest user message.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nINPUTS (READ ONLY)\n--------------------------------------------------\n- Latest user message:\n  {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n- inputProcessed flag:\n {{$context.$variables.inputProcessed}}\n\n- Persisted permit state:\n  {{$context.$variables.relatedPermitDetails}}\n\n  # Structure:\n  # {\n  #   \"<permit_name>\": {\n  #       \"triggered\": true | false | \"unknown\",\n  #       \"questions\": [string],\n  #       \"answers\": [true | false | null],\n  #       \"processed\": boolean\n  #   }\n  # }\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nGLOBAL HARD RULES\n--------------------------------------------------\n❗ Modify ONLY answers[]  \n❗ NEVER modify triggered  \n❗ NEVER overwrite existing true/false answers  \n❗ Only fill answers where value == null  \n❗ Only process ONE permit per interaction  \n❗ JSON ONLY, no explanations  \n\n--------------------------------------------------\nHARD EXIT RULE (ABSOLUTE PRIORITY)\n--------------------------------------------------\n inputProcessed = {{$context.$nodes.RELATED_GATE_QUESTIONS.$output.inputProcessed}}\nIf inputProcessed == true:\n\n→ Immediately return:\n   - relatedPermitDetails unchanged\n   - inputProcessed = true\n\n→ DO NOT execute any steps\n→ DO NOT evaluate user message\n→ STOP processing entirely\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nINPUT CONSUMPTION CONTRACT (CRITICAL)\n--------------------------------------------------\n❗ If inputProcessed == true:\n    → DO NOT use or interpret the user message\n    → DO NOT update any answers\n    → Return state unchanged\n    → inputProcessed must remain true\n\n❗ Only process inputMessage if inputProcessed == false\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSTEP 1: SELECT TARGET PERMIT\n--------------------------------------------------\nSelect the FIRST permit in order where:\n\n- triggered == true && processed == false\n- answers array contains at least one null\n\nThis is the ONLY permit you will update.\n\nIf no such permit exists:\n→ Return state unchanged\n→ inputProcessed = false\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSTEP 2: PARSE USER INPUT\n--------------------------------------------------\nCheck if the latest user message contains a positional sequence:\n\nExamples:\n- \"yes, no, yes\"\n- \"y n y\"\n- \"yes no yes\"\n- \"1 yes 2 no 3 yes\"\n\nNormalize:\n- lowercase\n- remove punctuation and numbering\n- map y → yes, n → no\n\nExtract ordered tokens:\n→ [\"yes\", \"no\", \"yes\"]\n\nIf no clear yes/no tokens found:\n→ Do not update anything\n→ inputProcessed = false\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSTEP 3: APPLY ANSWERS (POSITIONAL)\n--------------------------------------------------\nFor the selected permit:\n\n- Iterate over questions in order\n- For each index i:\n\n    If answers[i] == null AND token[i] exists:\n        - \"yes\" → answers[i] = true\n        - \"no\" → answers[i] = false\n\n    If answers[i] already true/false:\n        → DO NOT CHANGE\n\nStop when tokens are exhausted\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSTEP 4: UPDATE PROCESSED FLAG\n--------------------------------------------------\nIf ALL answers of particular permit are now true/false (no nulls remain):\n    → processed = true\nElse:\n    → processed remains false\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSTEP 5: INPUT PROCESSED DECISION (CRITICAL)\n--------------------------------------------------\n- If ANY answers were updated in this step:\n    → inputProcessed = true\n\n- If NO answers were updated:\n    → inputProcessed = false\n\n❗ DO NOT guess  \n❗ Only set true if actual state change occurred  \n\n--------------------------------------------------\nOUTPUT FORMAT (STRICT JSON ONLY)\n--------------------------------------------------\n{\n  \"relatedPermitDetails\": { ...updated state... },\n  \"inputProcessed\": true | false\n}\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nFINAL HARD CHECK\n--------------------------------------------------\n❗ Only one permit updated  \n❗ Existing answers NOT overwritten  \n❗ triggered NOT modified  \n❗ Order preserved  \n❗ inputProcessed must reflect actual updates  \n❗ JSON only"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\":\n    {\n        \"relatedPermitDetails\":\n        {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"description\": \"Initial Permit Type Selected based on user request.\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"required\":\n    [\n        \"relatedPermitDetails\"\n    ]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Set Related Permits Triggered"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1766207006829"
          },
          "code": "SET_RELATED_PERMITS_TRIGGERED",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1775765951691",
          "id": "1775710815171",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776060793488",
              "name": "inputProcessed",
              "scope": "JOB",
              "type": "boolean",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.RELATED_GATE_QUESTIONS.$output.inputProcessed}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "1775880149484",
              "name": "relatedPermitDetails",
              "scope": "JOB",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.INIT_RELATED_PERMITS.$output.result}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "SET_FIELDS"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Init Related Permits",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let relatedPermitDetails = {};\n\nlet permitTypes =\n    $context.$variables.permitTypeData || [];\n\nlet relatedPermits =\n    $context.$nodes.RELATED_GATE_QUESTIONS.$output.results || [];\n\nif (!Array.isArray(relatedPermits)) {\n    relatedPermits = [];\n}\n\nrelatedPermits.forEach(r => {\n\n     let permit = permitTypes.find(p =>\n        p.name?.toLowerCase() === r.name?.toLowerCase()\n    );\n\n    let questions = permit?.questions || [];\n    let triggered = r.triggered || false;\n    let code = permit?.RecordTypeId || \"\";\n\n    relatedPermitDetails[r.name] = {\n        code: code,\n        questions: questions,\n        triggered: triggered,\n        processed: false,\n        answers: new Array(questions.length).fill(null)\n    };\n});\n\nreturn {\n    result: relatedPermitDetails\n};"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775710815171"
          },
          "code": "INIT_RELATED_PERMITS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1775710815171",
          "id": "1775765951691",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
